          <p style="font-size:0.72rem; color:rgba(241,236,224,0.5); margin:0.2rem 0;">[1] Deloitte, 'AI-Assisted Medical Coding in PV', 2024 <span class="risk-med" style="font-size:0.6rem;">(Projected)</span></p>
          <p style="font-size:0.72rem; color:rgba(241,236,224,0.5); margin:0.2rem 0;">[2] MSSO MedDRA Maintenance Policy <span class="" style="font-size:0.6rem;">(Theoretical)</span></p>
          <p style="font-size:0.72rem; color:rgba(241,236,224,0.5); margin:0.2rem 0;">[3] Embedding search + LLM inference benchmark (Claude 3.5 Sonnet) <span class="risk-low" style="font-size:0.6rem;">(Measured)</span></p>
        </div>

